<title>UK: GECC sets 250 million mark Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 250 million mark Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.625     MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.19    PAY DATE   S30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.44     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
